msgid "When to sync"
msgstr "同步时间"

#: ui/app.slint:1766
msgid "Full check every"
msgstr "完整检查间隔"

#: ui/app.slint:1771
msgid "How often to check for changes"
msgstr "检查更改的频率"

#: ui/app.slint:1772
msgid "5 minutes"
msgstr "5 分钟"

#: ui/app.slint:1772
msgid "10 minutes"
msgstr "10 分钟"

#: ui/app.slint:1772
msgid "15 minutes"
msgstr "15 分钟"

#: ui/app.slint:1772
msgid "30 minutes"
msgstr "30 分钟"

#: ui/app.slint:1772
msgid "1 hour"
msgstr "1 小时"

#: ui/app.slint:1772
msgid "2 hours"
msgstr "2 小时"

#: ui/app.slint:1780
msgid ""
"Changes on this computer are sent right away, and personal accounts also get "
"online changes instantly. This sets how often a full check runs as well."
msgstr "此电脑上的更改会立即发送；个人账户也会立即获取在线更改。此项还会设置完整检查的间隔。"

#: ui/app.slint:1785
msgid "Only sync between"
msgstr "仅在以下时段同步"

#: ui/app.slint:1789
msgid "Schedule start time"
msgstr "计划开始时间"

#: ui/app.slint:1796
msgid "and"
msgstr "和"

#: ui/app.slint:1800
msgid "Schedule end time"
msgstr "计划结束时间"

#: ui/app.slint:1811
msgid ""
"Use 24-hour times. The window can cross midnight (for example 23:00 to 07:00 "
"for overnight only). \"Sync now\" still works outside it for an hour. Needs "
"the tray icon running."
msgstr "使用 24 小时制。时段可以跨午夜（例如只在夜间同步：23:00 到 07:00）。“立即同步”在时段外仍可使用一小时。需要托盘图标保持运行。"

#: ui/app.slint:1816
msgid "Speed limit"
msgstr "速度限制"

#: ui/app.slint:1821
msgid "Sync speed limit"
msgstr "同步速度限制"

#: ui/app.slint:1822
msgid "No limit"
msgstr "不限速"

#: ui/app.slint:1822
msgid "1 MB/s"
msgstr "1 MB/s"

#: ui/app.slint:1822
msgid "2 MB/s"
msgstr "2 MB/s"

#: ui/app.slint:1822
msgid "5 MB/s"
msgstr "5 MB/s"

#: ui/app.slint:1822
msgid "10 MB/s"
msgstr "10 MB/s"

#: ui/app.slint:1822
msgid "25 MB/s"
msgstr "25 MB/s"

#: ui/app.slint:1822
msgid "50 MB/s"
msgstr "50 MB/s"

#: ui/app.slint:1830
msgid "Applies to each file being transferred."
msgstr "限制适用于每个正在传输的文件。"

#: ui/app.slint:1833
msgid "Connect over IPv4 only"
msgstr "仅通过 IPv4 连接"

#: ui/app.slint:1837
msgid ""
"Can fix syncing that's slow to start or keeps timing out on some networks."
msgstr "如果某些网络上的同步启动缓慢或不断超时，此选项可能有帮助。"

#: ui/app.slint:1847
msgid "Direction"
msgstr "方向"

#: ui/app.slint:1850
msgid "Sync direction"
msgstr "同步方向"

#: ui/app.slint:1851
msgid "Both ways (normal)"
msgstr "双向（正常）"

#: ui/app.slint:1851
msgid "Download only"
msgstr "仅下载"

#: ui/app.slint:1851
msgid "Upload only"
msgstr "仅上传"

#: ui/app.slint:1862
msgid ""
"Keeps this computer a copy of what's online. Changes you make here aren't "
"sent to OneDrive."
msgstr "让这台电脑保留在线内容的副本。你在此处所做的更改不会发送到 OneDrive。"

#: ui/app.slint:1862
msgid ""
"Sends what you change here to OneDrive, but doesn't download changes made "
"online. Good for backing up this computer."
msgstr "将你在此处的更改发送到 OneDrive，但不下载在线更改。适合备份这台电脑。"

#: ui/app.slint:1862
msgid "Changes made here go to OneDrive, and changes made online come here."
msgstr "此处所做的更改会发送到 OneDrive，在线更改也会同步到此处。"

#: ui/app.slint:1865
msgid "Also delete files here that aren't online"
msgstr "同时删除此处不在线的文件"

#: ui/app.slint:1869
msgid ""
"This deletes files you put in this folder yourself, since they aren't "
"online. You'll see exactly what would be deleted before anything happens."
msgstr "这会删除你自行放入此文件夹的文件，因为它们不在线。执行前会清楚列出将要删除的内容。"

#: ui/app.slint:1875
msgid "Keep files online when I delete them here"
msgstr "在此处删除文件时仍保留在线文件"

#: ui/app.slint:1879
msgid ""
"Changing the direction is checked first with a dry run, so you can see what "
"would happen."
msgstr "更改同步方向前会先进行模拟检查，让你查看将会发生什么。"

#: ui/app.slint:1889
msgid "Files"
msgstr "文件"

#: ui/app.slint:1892
msgid ""
"When a file is deleted online, move it to this computer's Trash instead of "
"deleting it"
msgstr "在线删除文件时，将其移到这台电脑的回收站，而不是直接删除"

#: ui/app.slint:1896
msgid "Show desktop notifications for synced files"
msgstr "显示已同步文件的桌面通知"

#: ui/app.slint:1900
msgid "Don't sync hidden files and folders (names starting with a dot) *"
msgstr "不同步隐藏文件和文件夹（名称以点开头）*"

#: ui/app.slint:1906
msgid "Never sync files named *"
msgstr "永不同步以下名称的文件*"

#: ui/app.slint:1910
msgid "File name patterns to skip"
msgstr "要跳过的文件名模式"

#: ui/app.slint:1916
msgid "Separate patterns with | — for example  *.tmp|~*|Thumbs.db"
msgstr "使用 | 分隔模式，例如 *.tmp|~*|Thumbs.db"

#: ui/app.slint:1921
msgid "Never sync folders named *"
msgstr "永不同步以下名称的文件夹*"

#: ui/app.slint:1925
msgid "Folder names or paths to skip"
msgstr "要跳过的文件夹名称或路径"

#: ui/app.slint:1930
msgid "Add developer folders…"
msgstr "添加开发者文件夹…"

#: ui/app.slint:1937
msgid ""
"A name skips every folder called that; a path like Projects/Old skips that "
"folder."
msgstr "名称会跳过所有同名文件夹；路径（如 Projects/Old）只跳过该文件夹。"

#: ui/app.slint:1940
msgid "Don't sync symbolic links *"
msgstr "不同步符号链接*"

#: ui/app.slint:1944
msgid "Skip any folder that holds a file named .nosync *"
msgstr "跳过包含名为 .nosync 的文件的文件夹*"

#: ui/app.slint:1948
msgid "Sync shared folders I've added to My files *"
msgstr "同步我添加到“我的文件”的共享文件夹*"

#: ui/app.slint:1959
msgid "Safety"
msgstr "安全"

#: ui/app.slint:1962
msgid "Allow full resyncs for this account"
msgstr "允许此账户进行完整重新同步"

#: ui/app.slint:1966
msgid ""
"Changing which folders sync, or the settings marked *, makes the sync engine "
"rebuild its view of everything (a full resync). You always get a preview of "
"what would be downloaded, uploaded or deleted before anything happens. Turn "
"this off to lock those settings."
msgstr "更改同步文件夹或标有 * 的设置会让同步引擎重新建立对所有内容的视图（完整重新同步）。执行前始终会预览将下载、上传或删除的内容。关闭此项可锁定这些设置。"

#: ui/app.slint:1971
msgid "Stop and ask when more than"
msgstr "删除数量超过此值时停止并询问"

#: ui/app.slint:1975
msgid "Number of deleted items that stops syncing"
msgstr "触发停止同步的删除项目数"

#: ui/app.slint:1982
msgid "items are deleted at once"
msgstr "个项目同时被删除"

#: ui/app.slint:1990
msgid ""
"Protects against deleting a lot online by accident, for example when a "
"folder is moved out of OneDrive or a drive goes missing. Items inside "
"deleted folders count too. The client's default is 1000."
msgstr "防止意外在线删除大量内容，例如文件夹被移出 OneDrive 或驱动器丢失。已删除文件夹中的项目也会计入。客户端默认值为 1000。"

#: ui/app.slint:2005
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

#: ui/app.slint:2008
msgid "Fine-tune the sync engine. Most people never need these."
msgstr "微调同步引擎。大多数人不需要更改这些设置。"

